title: DNSSECVerif
abstract: >-
  SAPIC+ models, companion ProVerif models, verification scripts, and TLD
  census data for the ACM CCS 2026 paper Mind the Gap: Cross-RFC Formal
  Analysis Exposes DNSSEC's Hidden Vulnerabilities.
